g to the start after the final card. Each card shows a step in a story with a \'Step X of Y\' label in the top-right corner, along with a title, image, and description. When someone clicks the top card, it should lift up, rotate, and slide out to the side while fading away. The card underneath then bounces up to become the new top card. Add a subtle blur to the background during the card transitions.","add_elements.subgroup_name.slider_gallery":"Slider gallery","add.category.designer.made.wf-sticky-studio.label_tooltip_description":"Great for drawing attention to a specific section, this section sticks to the page as visitors scroll up and down.","responsive-SiteTheme-UpdateClass-Popup-Text":"When you update a style, everywhere that style is used will be adjusted to reflect the change.","DOM.updateDirectionModal.text":"This site’s direction doesn’t match the site’s language. To update the direction and reorganize the DOM order, open the Accessibility Wizard. ","connect_domain.entry_point.suggest.cta":"Connect Domain","vertical.Groups.list.page.app_DisplayName":"Group Page","add.section.portfolio.find-out-more":"Find out more","add.category.designer.made.studio-wsr-dashboard-selections.label_tooltip_description":"Let collaborators turn settings on and off.","add.category.google.maps.label":"Google Maps","editor-corvid.Banner.dev-on.button":"Turn off Dev Mode","component_generator.progress_bar.css.step_two.processing":"Loading...","LINK_PANEL_TAB_ADD_NEW_POP-UP_CREATE_LINK":"Create Now","add.category.designer.made.trends-transparentVids-studio.label":"Transparent videos","component_generator.progress_bar.manifest.step_three.processing":"Loading...","editor-components-imageX.displayMode.Fill":"Fill bounding box","site-checker.panel.issue-type.horizontal-stack-description":"Some elements are next to each other, but aren’t stacked. They could overlap on some screens.","responsive-SiteTheme.updateConfirmationModal.update.button":"Update","component_generator.preview_modal